You may drop your money in a shop (to get credit) and let your pet steal
anything including your money. From the credit you can buy and immediately
sell things and sell items you don't need. Having a strange sounding magic
whistle will speed up the process, so have a look into the tools shop (if
such a shop had been generated) whether you find such a whistle. You may
also sell items dropped from dead creatures.

